diff --git a/release-log.txt b/release-log.txt
index 1bc5e7d9c..05cb661c2 100644
--- a/release-log.txt
+++ b/release-log.txt
@@ -1,5 +1,6 @@
 -- Oozie 4.1.0 release (trunk - unreleased)

+OOZIE-1674 DB upgrade from 3.3.0 to trunk fails on postgres (rkanter)
 OOZIE-1581 Workflow performance optimizations (mona)
 OOZIE-1663 Queuedump to display command type (shwethags via virag)
 OOZIE-1672 UI info fetch fails for bundle having large number of coordinators (puru via rohini)

        You will be given the root cause of a bug, the commit message and the corresponding patch.
        You need to extract all code statements that lead to the bug from the patch, based on the root cause and the commit message.

        Root cause:
        The root cause of the bug was that the database upgrade process from version 3.3.0 to trunk failed on PostgreSQL due to improper handling of the `push_missing_dependencies` column. This column was added in `DB_VERSION_FOR_4_0` as a TEXT type and needed to be converted to BYTEA in `DB_VERSION_FOR_5_0`. However, if the database was already upgraded from `DB_VERSION_PRE_4_0` to `DB_VERSION_FOR_4_0` using Oozie 5, the column would already be in BYTEA format, leading to an attempt to convert it again and causing an error. The modifications introduced logic to check the `startingVersion` to avoid this unnecessary conversion.

        Commit message:
        OOZIE-1674 DB upgrade from 3.3.0 to trunk fails on postgres
 (rkanter)  

        Patch:
        diff --git a/tools/src/main/java/org/apache/oozie/tools/OozieDBCLI.java b/tools/src/main/java/org/apache/oozie/tools/OozieDBCLI.java
index 9b650b78d..116be5221 100644
